    title: "merge-pr's git-notes body preservation is unsatisfiable: the pre-push DCO hook rejects 'Notes added by git notes add' commits, which can never carry a sign-off"  # 482c
    status: todo_hard  # 482c
    priority: 3  # 482c
    parent:  # 482c
    tags:  # 482c
